# Implementation Plan: Section Tests & Final Course Exam with Secure Document Extraction

Build the assessment architecture for the Qualiva Course Creator Studio and Student learning workflow:
1. **Optional Section Tests** for each curriculum section.
2. **Compulsory Final Examination** at the end of the course.
3. **Secure Document Extraction Engine** for `.pdf` and `.docx` question banks with 4-stage anti-malware and vulnerability scanning.
4. **Creator & Admin Rule Configuration** (random question sampling pool, pass threshold percentage, timer, attempts).
5. **Anti-Cheating Student Assessment Experience** (zero answer leaks, sanitized payloads, server-side grading).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Pure JavaScript Only**: All server and client code will be written in pure standard JavaScript (no TypeScript).
> - **Compulsory Final Exam Rule**: When creating or publishing a course, the Final Exam is mandatory. A course in DRAFT mode can be saved, but publishing to ACTIVE requires the Final Exam to be configured.
> - **UI Aesthetic**: Professional, sleek, and minimal design matching the Qualiva Royal Blue theme with AnimateIcons micro-interactions and zero clutter.

